{
  "Disk map": "磁盘地图",
  "What is taking up the room: a ring of folders you can walk into, mark, and have the application clear away.": "看看是什么占用了空间：一圈可以走进去、可以标记、并交给应用清理掉的文件夹。",
  "A ring of what is taking up the room.": "以环形展示占用空间的内容。",
  "Rings": "环数",
