  "Minutes. A folder that has been measured is remembered and drawn at once; past this it is walked again on opening. Rescan always reads it afresh.": "单位为分钟。计算过的文件夹会被记住并立即画出；超过此时间后，打开时会重新遍历。“重新扫描”总是从头读取。",
  "Count hidden files": "计入隐藏文件",
